Document Results and Lessons Learned
Results Summary
MVP Outcomes
The SelfLab MVP successfully achieved all planned objectives defined in the Project Charter. The MVP delivered the required core functionalities necessary to validate the platform concept and provide an initial learning experience for users.
The completed MVP features are:
1. Code Evaluation System
    * Developed a customizable code evaluation system supporting the C programming language.
    * Enabled automated testing and evaluation of submitted solutions.
    * Designed the system to be extendable for supporting additional programming languages and evaluation methods in the future.
2. Curriculum Designer
    * Developed a curriculum creation system that allows users to design and organize educational content.
    * Provided the required tools for structuring learning paths and managing educational materials.
3. Curriculum Browser
    * Implemented a browsing system that allows users to explore available curricula and learning paths.
4. Learning System
    * Developed the core learning workflow that connects users with educational content and practical coding experiences.
Objectives Completion
The MVP achieved 100% completion of the planned MVP objectives:
